{"body":"This issue is part of the [Adopt Bazel](https://github.com/tensorflow/tfjs/projects/17) project and tracks converting the above package(s) to build with Bazel. For details on how to convert a package, take a look at the [Bazel Migration](https://github.com/tensorflow/tfjs/blob/master/BAZEL_MIGRATION.md) doc.\r\n\r\nDepends on #5275, #5278","canonical_uri":"https://github.com/tensorflow/tfjs/issues/5279","repository":"tensorflow/tfjs","updated_at":"2021-10-22T01:58:27Z"}